// # emit-x86 const-int divide
//
// Logline: Print 6 divided by 2 so emit-x86 can lower a const-int div to 3.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print 6 divided by 2.
//   3. as+ld stdout is 3, not 62.
//
// residual: rem stays later.

pub fn main() {
    println(6 / 2);
}
